9c762f-275a-7ff9-9a1a-bd1aadc4f41b","type":0,"time":"2026-02-19T13:55:27.000Z","important":1,"data":{"pic":"","title":"","content":"【Canada’s 2025 Trade Deficit Widest on Record Excluding Pandemic】Canada’s trade deficit widened to C$31.3 billion in 2025, the largest annual shortfall outside the Covid-19 pandemic, as US tariffs weighed on key exports, Statistics Canada reported. Annual exports fell 0.2%, with shipments to the US down 5.8% and imports from the US down 2.9%, narrowing the US trade surplus to C$81.6 billion from C$101.3 billion in 2024. Exports to non-US countries rose 17.2% while imports grew 12.4%, but Canada’s trade deficit with other countries widened to C$112.9 billion from C$108.4 billion. Strong gold prices partially masked the impact of the US trade war, and excluding unwrought gold, December’s deficit was C$7.1 billion. That month, only 67.4% of exports went to the US, the lowest outside the pandemic."},"remark":[],"hot":false,"hot_start":null,"hot_end":null,"classify":[],"impact":[{"impact":"bullish","symbol":"XAUUSD"}],"classification":[]},{"id":"019c762e-c6e6-7ff9-9a1a-b7529c946ee6","type":0,"time":"2026-02-19T13:55:02.000Z","important":1,"data":{"pic":"","title":"","content":"UK BLOCKING TRUMP FROM USING BASES FOR STRIKES ON IRAN - TIMES"},"remark":[],"hot":false,"hot_start":null,"hot_end":null,"classify":[],"impact":[{"impact":"bearish","symbol":"XAUUSD"},{"impact":"bearish","symbol":"WTI"},{"impact":"bearish","symbol":"DXY"}],"classification":[]},{"id":"019c762e-822b-7ff9-9a1a-a946d85e475b","type":0,"time":"2026-02-19T13:54:45.000Z","important":1,"data":{"pic":"","title":"","content":"UK HAS NOT YET GIVEN PERMISSION ON US USING RAF BASES - TIMES"},"remark":[],"hot":false,"hot_start":null,"hot_end":null,"classify":[],"impact":[{"impact":"bearish","symbol":"GBPUSD"},{"impact":"bullish","symbol":"DXY"}],"classification":[{"id":50005,"pid":0,"name":"Market Regions","child":[{"id":80028,"name":"Europe & UK"}]}]},{"id":"019c7629-b317-7ff9-9a1a-